  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support To Govt Of India National Secondary Education Programme( Rashtriya Madhyamik Shiksha Abhiyaan)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To make good quality secondary education accessible and affordable to all young persons in the age group of 15 -18 years, particularly girls, through supporting the development and implementation of a new Government of India (GoI) Central Scheme called Rashtriya Madhyamik Shiksha Abhiyan (National Secondary Education Mission). Financial grant support will end in Dec 2014. Technical assistance via an internationally competitive tendered procurement will end in March 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
